try></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO SHIBAURA ELECTRIC CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IBUKI, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KABUSHIKI KAISHA TOSHIBA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, YUUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IBUKI HIROAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO YUUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IBUKI, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, YUUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A color cathode-ray tube device including trajectory correcting means (14, 15) for giving a pair of side beams (4B, 4R) over- or under-convergence at the peripheral part with respect to the center of the phosphor screen. The trajectory correcting means produce a magnetic field such that there is a region where the magnetic field exerts no force on the three electron beams (4B, 4G, 4R) in the magnetic field and the region is away from the plane including the tube axis and a first or second direction. Even if such trajectory correcting means is provided to a color cathode-ray tube having a flat screen realized by means of a shadow mask produced by press forming, degradation of the characteristics, such as degradation of the focusing characteristic and distortion is not caused.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Dispositif tube cathodique couleur qui comporte des moyens de correction (14, 15) de trajectoire destinés à impartir à une paire de faisceaux latéraux (4B, 4R) une surconvergence ou une sousconvergence sur la partie périphérique par rapport au centre de l'écran fluorescent. Les moyens de correction de trajectoire produisent un champ magnétique tel qu'il existe une région dans laquelle le champ magnétique n'exerce pas de force sur les trois faisceaux électroniques (4B, 4G, 4R) dans le champ magnétique et ladite région est éloignée du plan comportant l'axe du tube et un premier ou un second sens. Même si ce moyen de correction de trajectoire est associé à un tube cathodique couleur ayant un écran plat réalisé à l'aide d'un masque perforé produit par estampage, la dégradation de la caractéristique de focalisation et la distorsion ne se produisent pas.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>